Z||000000||qwikgta||05-08-2001||10:16 PM||||I just bought a Hooker tri y header for my 2.5L Duke.  Not sure if it will fit.  I see that the Fiero Store has diff part number for 84-86 and 87/88 Exhaust manifolds.  So will it fit, do I need some 84-86 parts, gaskets and O2 Sensor ect.... Any help, thanks<P>Rob<P>------------------<BR>qwikgta@yahoo.com<BR>88 T-Top coupe<BR>http://robsfieroproject.homestead.com/index.html<BR>http://vafiero.com||||reg||1
