Z||000004||Dave Gunsul||05-09-2001||08:09 PM||||According to Hooker their header is made<BR>for the 84-86 only! Holley owns the company<BR>now so check Holley.com.<BR>Also interesting is that they have two different headers for those years one for the stock cat and the other will not fit the cat. <P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
